Fixes:
- Write colours with transparency through color-mix instead of appending a hex alpha, so rgb(), hsl(), oklch() and 3- or 8-digit hex colours keep their tints.
- The upload label was fixed copy and only the first three files were listed, so a third sibling or more vanished without a word; the label is a setting, every file is listed and the layout shrinks to fit the list.

